{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"72499","name":"Grand Mogador Menara & Spa","description":"Indulge in onsite body treatments and facials at the Grand Mogador Menara, conveniently located near Avenue Mohamed VI in Marrakech. Enjoy this hotel's recreational amenities, including a health club, sauna, and seasonal outdoor pool. Stay connected with complimentary Wi-Fi and take advantage of concierge services and the gift shops/newsstands. Savor local and international cuisine at one of the two onsite restaurants, including 'International (Badiaa), ' or order room service during limited hours. Two coffee shops/cafés offer snacks. Buffet breakfast is available daily (7:00 AM to 10:30 AM) for a fee. The hotel also features a business center, dry cleaning/laundry services, and a 24-hour front desk. For events, the hotel offers 377 square feet (35 square meters) of space, including a conference center and six meeting rooms. Free self-parking is available onsite. The 244 air-conditioned rooms feature minibars, flat-screen televisions, complimentary Wi-Fi, and bathrooms with bathtubs or showers, complimentary toiletries, and bidets. Phones and safes are also provided, and housekeeping is daily. Nearby attractions include the Palais des Congrès, Royal Tennis Harti, and Menara Mall, all within a short distance. Menara Airport (RAK) is the preferred airport.","address":"Avenue Mohamed Vi","city":"MARRAKECH","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.6239,"lng":-8.01251,"stars":5,"chain":"MOGAD","giataCode":"86923","phone":"+212524339330","email":"hmenararesa@mogadorhotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/072499/072499a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/072499/072499a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/072499/072499a_hb_ro_020_20250422_093542.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.